INSERT INTO results (coach_name, sport, team, age_group, date, opposition, result, feedback) VALUES
  ('Kabelo', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U17', '2026-07-30T12:00:00Z', 'Trinityhouse Randpark', '2-2 Drew', 'We were in a winning position until I made my substitutions to give everyone a chance and we let it slip there. No chemistry whatsoever'),
  ('Thembi', 'Hockey', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'u11 B', '2026-07-30T12:00:00Z', 'Bryandale A', 'lost 3-0', 'For this game, the boys that played the B team game also played the A team game, they played well but became tired as the game progressed. They still played really. I''m looking for to the rest of the season with them'),
  ('Thembi', 'Hockey', NULL, 'u11 A', '2026-07-30T12:00:00Z', 'Bryandale', 'lost 1-0', 'The boys played their first game today and it was impressive. Most of them are playing for the first time so it took a while for them to adjust to the game but they eventually progressed as the game went. Unfortunately in the final minute of the game they made a mistake which led into a goal, but despite the result they played well for their first game'),
  ('Lebo', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U15', '2026-07-30T12:00:00Z', 'Hoerskool Goudrif', 'Drew 2-2', 'Impressed with the fight back from the boyz being 2-0 down in the first half and coming back draw level. But we need to be clinical we should killing the games early'),
  ('Kabelo', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U17', '2026-07-28T12:00:00Z', 'Redford house blue hills', '2-1 Lose', 'Theres a lot of work still to be done with my ladies, with more training sessions we can be better'),
  ('Coach Lebo', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U15', '2026-07-28T12:00:00Z', 'Copper field college', 'Won 2-1', 'Although the boyz had a brilliant game we still lacking on some aspects that could get us punished in future but overall happy with the performance as we go back to the drawing board'),
  ('Jolie Ngoyi', 'Tennis', 'Crawford Sandton', 'U10', '2026-07-28T12:00:00Z', 'Rivonia', 'Draw 21/21', 'The Boys B team did well in their singles as they won all their singles matches. But lost in their doubles due to lack of focus and team work'),
  ('Coach Justin and Coach Lebo', 'Football', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U13', '2026-06-11T12:00:00Z', 'Liecester road school', 'Won 2-1', 'The boy''s march to the final of the discovery cup with a 2-1 win after extra time the boy''s really fought hard and deserved today''s win'),
  ('Kabelo', 'Football', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'U8', '2026-06-04T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford lonehil', '3-2 Win', 'They played like their lives depend on it. Elite mentality'),
  ('Coach Justin & Coach Lebo', 'Football', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U13', '2026-06-04T12:00:00Z', 'Yeshiva', 'Won 4-3', 'A good entertaining game from the boy''s very happy with their performance they march onto the semi finals of the discovery cup'),
  ('Coach Justin', 'Football', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U8', '2026-06-04T12:00:00Z', 'Orbin Primary', 'Won 6-0', 'Strong way to end this week''s round of fixtures good work by both boys and girls in the team !'),
  ('Thembi', 'Football', 'Bellavista', 'u13', '2026-06-03T12:00:00Z', 'Holy family College', 'lost 1-0', 'Despite the loss, today the boys and girls played their best game of the season so far. They dominated the game and had a lot of chance to score. The goal that was conceded was an unlucky goal. I was very proud of all of them today and i can see improvement in teamwork and dedication from them, now the goal is to keep playing like so that we can produce good results. Really good game today'),
  ('UNATHI Thango', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U9-13 Girls', '2026-05-29T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', '2-2 draw', 'What an amazing performance the girls had today. Started a little slow by going down by 2 but after the second half they really rallied together and was able to get 2 goals and were even close to getting a 3rd but time beat us this time. Big and important saves from Nsovo in the second half and our seniors coming out big with goals from Tumi and Soso. What a way to end our last game of the season.'),
  ('Nonkululeko', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'Girls senior', '2026-05-29T12:00:00Z', 'Montrose primary school', 'Won 2-0', 'Besides the results all in all the girls played superb today. They were able to keep ball position, passing their teams mates very well. First time seeing them using their corner kicks. Was a good game overall.'),
  ('Jolie Ngoyi', 'Football', 'Crawford Sandton', 'U13', '2026-05-29T12:00:00Z', 'Grayston primary', 'Lost 6-0', 'It was really tough match as our best goal keeper are still injured, but overall the girls are improving just need to work on their conference'),
  ('Shalom', 'Hockey', 'Rallim', 'U10 B', '2026-05-28T12:00:00Z', 'Parklands college', '2-2', 'Plaued very well attack and defense very proud of them although they are U10B they played against parkland college''s u10A team so im genuinely proud of them and the fight they put on'),
  ('Shalom', 'Hockey', 'Rallim', 'U10 A', '2026-05-28T12:00:00Z', 'Parklands college', 'Drew 0-0', 'Proud is a understatement the girls havent won a match ever since they started playing even when i met them they were so demotivated but for them to Draw with a U11 team a age group bigger than them makes me so proud they even shot a goal but one foot was outside the striking circle so it didnt count as a goal but none the less i still count it as a win and this is the closest they have ever been to winning'),
  ('Kabelo', 'Football', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'U8', '2026-05-28T12:00:00Z', 'Bryandale Primary', '0-0 draw', 'We were the better team in every department. We out passed the opposition, out ran them, created more chances, we just failed to score. I am a happy coach though'),
  ('Coach Justin', 'Football', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U13', '2026-05-27T12:00:00Z', 'Macauley', 'Won 6-2', 'Wow wow wow big shout out to my Redfordd U13 who finished the season with a 6-1 win, very impressive football as well as result i think we can still work on some things overall. Discovery QF next week let''s gooo'),
  ('Sam', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'u12', '2026-05-27T12:00:00Z', 'Robin Hill', 'Team A won 3-2 Team B Lost 7-0', 'The B team was more of the kids that never come to practice, there was absolutely no discipline during the game, always blaming others instead of taking countability and play the match. Also I said it to them if you don''t come to practice, results will eventually show. Team A was amazing, we had a slow start but we managed to finish strong as always. towards the end we started getting too comfortable and the other team mange to score the second goal. however it was a great match to watch.'),
  ('Sam', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'u12', '2026-05-27T12:00:00Z', 'Robin Hill', 'Team A Won 3-2', NULL),
  ('Coach Sipho', 'Football', 'Lion Pride Academy', 'U7', '2026-05-27T12:00:00Z', 'Green School', 'Lost 6-0', 'Tough day at the office but I''m proud of the boys for sticking together. Losing 6-0 isn''t fun, but there''s some lessons we can take from this game. No one gave up, even at 4-0 down. We had 4-5 passes where we strung our passes together. Our GK made some big saves. Things to work on: Shape & Spacing, Tracking Runners. One loss doesn''t define our season'),
  ('Coach Sipho', 'Football', 'Lion Pride Academy', 'U7', '2026-05-27T12:00:00Z', 'Eden Chartwell', 'Won 2-1', 'From Kickoff we were up for it. Pressing high, chasing every ball. That''s the standard now. We kept it simple, 2-3 passes and we were through. Goal 1 came from exactly that. Coaching Points: First Touch, Communication.'),
  ('coach thembi', 'Football', 'Bellavista', 'u13', '2026-05-27T12:00:00Z', 'Knights School', 'lost 9-0', 'The boys and girls made mistakes yesterday that led to the goals that were conceded. I feel like throughout the game after conceding goals they lost their confidence to come back. There''s a lot that still needs to be worked on and we will work on it during training'),
  ('Nonkululeko', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'Boyz under 10 A & B', '2026-05-27T12:00:00Z', 'Robin hills primary school', 'A. Lost 1-0. B. Lost 5-0', 'Firstly game there was a lot of intensity we only lost concentration in the last few minutes that''s when we made a mistake and got punished. Second game i think the boys were nowhere, no one came to the party they were just playing.'),
  ('Ross Goodwin', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U11', '2026-05-27T12:00:00Z', 'Kings Linbro', 'Lost 9-0', 'We played away and the game started off badly with an early goal from the opposition. The ref was terrible, complete bias towards the other team and did not know the rules as he was a rugby referee. Despite the situation with the referee, the boys kept pushing and didn''t drop their heads. They fought till the end despite the drama'),
  ('Mamello', 'Football', 'Lion Pride Academy', 'U9', '2026-05-27T12:00:00Z', 'Green School & Eden Schools Chartwell', 'A Team Lost 4-0 & B Team Drew 2-2', 'A Team needs to work more on defending the ball and communicating on the field like calling each other''s names and advicing on a play. B Team played really well good communication and implementation of simple plays on the field. Overall great improvement on players skills individually.'),
  ('Oregolele Sekwena', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U9 boys (Team 1 and 2)', '2026-05-27T12:00:00Z', 'Kings Linbro park', 'Lost 2-0 (team 1) Won 2-1 (team 2)', 'The boys performed well but they still need more training, fitness was their biggest issue today but they played well'),
  ('Oregolele Sekwena', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U9 boys (Team 1 and 2)', '2026-05-27T12:00:00Z', 'Kings Linbro park', 'Lost 2-0 (team 1) Won 2-1 (team 2)', 'The boys performed well but they still need more training, fitness was their biggest issue today but they played well'),
  ('Sam', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'u12', '2026-05-26T12:00:00Z', 'Pinnacle College', 'lost 2-0', 'the boys were amazing in the first half, it just so happen that the team that we were playing with was really strong, we didnt even think we would play as good. it was a great game to watch and i told the boys we try again next year'),
  ('Shakirah', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U9', '2026-05-26T12:00:00Z', 'Mini festival', 'Lost the first game; Won their second game', 'The girls showed great effort, losing the first match and winning the second. Key areas for improvement are creating space, sticking to partners to avoid bunching, and improving jumping height and timing for better ball contests. Overall, good determination and progress shown.'),
  ('Remi', 'Football', 'Colin Mann', 'U12', '2026-05-25T12:00:00Z', 'Laerskool Germiston', 'Lost 2-0', 'Our midfield has been a continuous problem. Creating a massive gap in between attack and defence. The 2 goals conceded came from one player playing way to deep and playing the opposition onside'),
  ('Busani', 'Football', 'Colin Mann', 'U11', '2026-05-25T12:00:00Z', 'Laerskool Germiston', 'Lost 4-1', 'Today is bad loss, not just because of the score but the performance wasn''t up to standard. However I don''t care that much about the result because I told the boys in the beginning that I don''t care about winning and lossing as much as I care about progress. And there has been progress and because of that, after the last game of the season I am proud of my boys and proud to have been their coach'),
  ('Nonkululeko', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'Girls senior', '2026-05-25T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford lonehill preparatory school', 'Lost 7 - 0', 'The girls today where very unlucky. We got punished over our mistakes at the back.'),
  ('Nonkululeko', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'Girls senior', '2026-05-22T12:00:00Z', 'Bryandale primary school', 'Lost 4 - 0', 'The girls did try their best but it was so tough today we played one of the best teams. It is one of those days but I''m proud for the girls. Today to be honest I''m very speechless; hurting.'),
  ('UNATHI Thango', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U9-13 Girls', '2026-05-22T12:00:00Z', 'Pinnacle College Kyalami', 'Lost 4-0', 'Again a very tough match against a good opponent. The girls are playing better but the physicality unfortunately is not on our side as I do have some small grade 4s playing against grade 6 and 7 but they play their hearts out. Meekah with a stand out performance in defense today'),
  ('Sam', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'U11 girls', '2026-05-22T12:00:00Z', 'Bryandale', 'lost 2-1', 'The girls started leading and lost with 2 goals in the second half, they gave up during the game which is our biggest challenge with them, they get too excited and end up forgetting to work still thinking we have won. the other team was a lot more hungry than us and scored 2 goals'),
  ('Deon', 'Netball', 'Lion Pride Academy', 'U10', '2026-05-21T12:00:00Z', 'Maria montessori', 'Won 14-4', 'The girls showed great improvement in todays game. Their teamwork, passing and confidence on the court have grown so much and it was good to see them putting in so much effort from start to finish.'),
  ('Mamello', 'Football', 'Lion Pride Academy', 'U9', '2026-05-21T12:00:00Z', 'Maria Montessori House', 'Lost 5 - 1', 'This was the boy''s first match and I could see them implementing what we do in practice. We just need to improve on communication on the field and how we play as a team.'),
  ('Busani Ndlovu', 'Football', 'Colin Mann', 'U11', '2026-05-21T12:00:00Z', 'Primrose Hill', 'Drew 1-1', 'Good game. We conceded early again which affected us in the beginning but the boys put in a huge effort to come back. Overall proud of the improvement and how they keep fighting, we''re not the most technical but we''re definitely going to put up a fight.'),
  ('Akimi', 'Hockey', 'Rallim', 'U9', '2026-05-21T12:00:00Z', 'Elkanah', 'Won 3-1', 'Beautiful hockey. Beautiful team work. Just overall an amazing win. I''ve been blessed with a talented group of players who have so much potential and they showed it today, as they absolutely dominated the entire game from start to finish.'),
  ('Shalom', 'Hockey', 'Rallim', 'U11A', '2026-05-21T12:00:00Z', 'ELKANAH primary school', 'Lost 9-0', 'Despite the loss they played very well they actually communicated and looked who they are hitting to but we have to work on foot, hacking and own goal'),
  ('Shalom', 'Hockey', 'Rallim', 'U10 B', '2026-05-21T12:00:00Z', 'ELKANAH', 'Lost 1 -0', 'Majority of my team played this match and they played very well but we really need to work on the own goal'),
  ('Thembi', 'Netball', 'Parkview Senior', 'u11', '2026-05-21T12:00:00Z', 'Emmarentia', 'lost 16-2', 'Today we gave a chance to the girls who haven''t played any fixtures yet to play. The girls need to work on catching the ball and moving the ball faster during the game.'),
  ('Kabelo', 'Football', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'U8', '2026-05-21T12:00:00Z', 'Kings college', '3-0 Win', 'Team driven win. Happy for my boys.'),
  ('Kerryn', 'Netball', 'Parkview Senior', 'U10', '2026-05-21T12:00:00Z', 'Emmerentia', 'Lost 2-1', 'The girls really played well, they just got unlucky with their shooting but I''m proud of them!'),
  ('Thembi', 'Football', 'Bellavista', 'U13', '2026-05-20T12:00:00Z', 'Carlswarld', 'Lost 4-0', 'The game started off well in the first half but in the second half everyone lost focus and didn''t work as a team. Need to work on better team communication with the players and positional sense.'),
  ('abbey', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'u13', '2026-05-20T12:00:00Z', 'NWCS', 'won 14-9', 'Girls made silly mistakes. Match performance wasn''t like it usually is. Still secured a win, but could''ve played WAY better. It has been an amazing season and i am super proud of the girls.'),
  ('Daniel', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U11 and U10', '2026-05-20T12:00:00Z', 'Reddam Waterfall', 'Lost 5-4 and 6-3', 'A lot to work on in terms of defence and goal keeping. Overall it was a very productive term for the boys.'),
  ('Coach Justin', 'Football', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U13', '2026-05-20T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Cosmo', 'Won 3-2', 'The boys played an excellent game, there is still plenty of areas to work on but they are getting the fundamentals right, they only put themselves under pressure when having to come from behind, overall they adapt well and push to the end.'),
  ('Nonkululeko', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'U/10 A & B boys', '2026-05-20T12:00:00Z', 'Fairways primary school', 'U/10 A won 7-2. B. Draw 1-1', 'There is nothing more to watch when you see the boys/players improvement every game. I''m speechless i was so impressed. More especially to my goalkeepers both A & B teams such an excellent work done by them.'),
  ('Berneeta Fox', 'Football', 'Bellavista', 'U12', '2026-05-20T12:00:00Z', 'Carlswald', 'Lost 4-2', 'The boys played an entertaining game, it was intense but they played well as a team. There is still a lot to work on but I now have a clearer understanding of what to work on'),
  ('Berneeta Fox', 'Football', 'Bellavista', 'U9', '2026-05-20T12:00:00Z', 'Carlswald', 'Loss 3-0', 'The boys had difficulties connecting with one another, they kept fighting with one another instead of playing the game. Very distracted, a lot to work on especially team building'),
  ('Sam', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'u12', '2026-05-20T12:00:00Z', 'fairways', 'Team A won 4-3 team B won 4-2', 'The team is getting stronger, we starting to understand the game with each other and everyone knows exactly what to do than when we started in the beginning of the season.'),
  ('abbey', 'Hockey', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'u13', '2026-05-20T12:00:00Z', 'NWCS', 'won 14-9', 'Girls made silly mistakes. Match performance wasn''t like it usually is. Still secured a win, but could''ve played WAY better. It has been an amazing season and i am super proud of the girls.'),
  ('Lebogang', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U13', '2026-05-20T12:00:00Z', 'Reddam waterfall', 'Lost 5-3', 'Much better performance the defense let us down a few times but overall happy with the boy''s been impressive this season'),
  ('Lebogang', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U12', '2026-05-20T12:00:00Z', 'Reddam Waterfall', 'Lost 13-0', 'Disaster class. We were way off the game and we are struggling in a major area the goalkeeper department. Dissapointing performance'),
  ('Nosipho Dhlamini', 'Football', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U11', '2026-05-20T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Cosmo', 'Lost 2-1', 'We played against an organised team but the boys came prepared too, we are now conceding less goals, and attacking more we just didn''t capitalize on our chances overall I''m very proud of the boys performance'),
  ('Olebogeng', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', NULL, '2026-05-20T12:00:00Z', 'Sandton Sinai', 'Won 4-1', 'Still needs to be a lot of improvement. Ball control, Off the ball movement, Shooting. Yeah all the basics needs to be worked on'),
  ('Oregolele Sekwena', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U9 boys (Team 1 and 2)', '2026-05-20T12:00:00Z', 'Sandton Sinai', 'won 7-2 and drew 1-1', 'The team performed wonderfully, they are more comfortable on the ball and on the attack and that has benefitted them a lot. I am very proud of their performance'),
  ('Bahle Mnene', 'Football', 'St Francis', 'U15', '2026-05-19T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Serengeti', 'Lost 2-0', 'Defence needs to work as a team, CDM needs to learn how to connect the ball from defence to attack. Striker not visible. Team needs to learn pressure play (they make many unnecessary touches and end up passing opponents).'),
  ('Victor', 'Football', NULL, 'U/12', '2026-05-19T12:00:00Z', 'Pinnacle college kayalami', 'Lost 8-0', 'We really lack in the back line and the goal keeper department. But we had a very strong first half until we got exposed that we don''t have a keeper'),
  ('Sam', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'u12', '2026-05-19T12:00:00Z', 'curro riverside', 'won 4-2', 'the boys had a very slow start, first half was 1-0 and in the second half the other team came back stronger and they scored 2 goals which ended up being 2-1, we came back towards the end and scored one more goal to make it draw. in the extra time thats when the boys started picking up their socks and playing football and scored two more goals.'),
  ('Sam', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'u12', '2026-05-19T12:00:00Z', 'Norwood', 'won 4-2', 'It was a great game to watch and also it was stressful at the same time, both teams wanted the win and all i can say we wanted it more than the other opponent which ended up with a win as well. now we through to next round for our discovery'),
  ('Musa Mnguni', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U19', '2026-05-18T12:00:00Z', 'Greenside', 'Won 38-8', 'The team really played well. It started off a bit slow and out of place, I think the team was a bit nervous because it was their last game. But in the last 3 quarters their pace improved and it looked like they took control of the game. It was definitely not an easy win but they made it look easy towards the end. I feel honoured to have coached this team.'),
  ('Sa', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'u11', '2026-05-18T12:00:00Z', 'yashiva', 'lost 4-0', 'the girls had a rough start, we lost 3-0 in the first half and in the second half we as hard as we can and they scored only 1 goal. I believe we just need more practice to do this right'),
  ('Victor', 'Football', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'U/12', '2026-05-16T12:00:00Z', 'Carsworld,Grayston,Redhill', '1-0 lost,1-0 won 3-0 lost', 'Since this was our second time playing since the season started I should say the boys have improved so much, they were more tougher on the ball they showed so much hunger and improvement. we just lacked so much in the center backs that''s where all the teams broke through but I believe we still gonna do so much better in the coming games'),
  ('Victor', 'Football', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'U/12', '2026-05-16T12:00:00Z', 'Carlsworld,Grayson,Redhill', '1-0 loo', NULL),
  ('Victor', 'Football', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'U/12', '2026-05-16T12:00:00Z', 'Carsworld,Grayson,', 'V', NULL),
  ('Nonkululeko', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'Girls senior', '2026-05-15T12:00:00Z', 'Grayston preparatory school', 'Lost 5 - 0', 'The girls really tried our opposition was way to strong but we managed to squeeze to a better second half. We lost but still gonna do our best next Monday for Discovery cup'),
  ('Berneeta Fox', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U12', '2026-05-15T12:00:00Z', 'Holy Family', 'Lost 3-0', 'The girls played a better second game, they were more focused and tried to correct their mistakes they made in the first game. They still need to work on their defence and footwork but they willing to make the efforts to correct which is important'),
  ('Berneeta Fox', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U12', '2026-05-15T12:00:00Z', 'FDR', 'Lost 6-1', 'The girls played a fair game despite the unfair calls made by the umpire. They made some mistakes on their part which caused a possession advantage for the other team, they were playing according to the opponent pace and not their own'),
  ('abbey', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'u13', '2026-05-15T12:00:00Z', 'Holy Family', 'Won 19-8', 'Despite having an offish first game. The girls kept their spirits & energy high and the performance level even higher! Amazing netball was played during this game, with minimal calls from the umpires. From defending to attacking everyone played and executed their roles on court beautifully. The girls used the space on the court nicely and applied lots of pressure forcing the other team into panic mode but kept the game at our pace, which we gained a big advantage of the game resulting in a beautiful win! Super proud of my netball stars and the growth i am seeing within the team!'),
  ('abbey', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'u13', '2026-05-15T12:00:00Z', 'FDR', 'Lost 14-11', 'girls played well - Unfair calls made by the umpire which costed us the game. But overall the girls are getting along nicely on court and communication is soo much better. On monday a new game strategy was introduced for game performance and the girls applied it in the match and it was effective - overall very proud of the team!'),
  ('Sam', 'Football', 'Parkview Junior', 'u11', '2026-05-15T12:00:00Z', 'greyston', 'lost 5-0', 'very nervous in the first half because the other team was very physical and they were not scared of anything which intimidated the girls even more. I just love the fact that they were very scared however their fighting spirit was still there'),
  ('Jolie Ngoyi', 'Football', 'Crawford Sandton', 'U12 to open', '2026-05-15T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford lonehill', 'Lost 9-1,1-0', 'For team A it was a great improvement compared to last year games, the first half they were nervous but they got better in the second half and managed to score a goal. B team did well just need to improve our goal keepers skills'),
  ('UNATHI Thango', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U9-13 Girls', '2026-05-15T12:00:00Z', 'Buccleuch Primary School', 'Lost 4-1', 'A lot more positive performance. The girls showed up and moved the ball a lot better than last week and had a lot of shots at goal. Soso and Tumi stepped up as leaders and took responsibility in their hands to keep us in the game. Kopano and Tsegofatso with great work ethic. Proud of how the girls applied the things we worked on during the week like defensive shape and passing to the open player. Only negative is that we had 9 players. If we had at least 11 players I believe we win that game. Lost in the last 5 mins because of fatigue.'),
  ('Katheerah', 'Netball', 'Bellavista', 'U11', '2026-05-14T12:00:00Z', 'Japari School', 'Drew 5-5', 'N/A'),
  ('Musa Mnguni', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U19', '2026-05-14T12:00:00Z', 'Vorentoe', 'Won 43-4', 'The first thing that went very well during the game is that the team stuck to the game plan that we worked on during practice. It was impressive to see them implement those strategies during the game and their communication have improved massively. We worked on every infringement we were called out for in our previous matches to avoid the same mistakes and it worked out well because there were less infringements and the game was flowing.'),
  ('Kabelo', 'Football', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'U8', '2026-05-14T12:00:00Z', 'Bryanston Primary school', 'Lost 3-0', 'I was disappointed in my boys in the first half. They have a tendency of being scared of the other players but the attitude was good coming back on the second half. It was just a pity we couldn''t convert'),
  ('Lebogang', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U12', '2026-05-14T12:00:00Z', 'Pinnacle college kyalami', 'Lost 3-0', 'Unfortunately today wasn''t the best of our playing ability we just didn''t respond or be in the same tempo as our opponents not really a tough game but something you can reflect on and fix moving forward.'),
  ('Lebogang', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U13', '2026-05-14T12:00:00Z', 'Pinnacle college kyalami', 'Lost 4-1', 'Unfortunately fatigue was creeping up on the players and we were playing at a disadvantage the school had big players with good shooting abilities they just took shots from range to punish us a positive game approach it''s unfortunate the energy levels were a bit low today we move onto the next game with our heads up high first lose of the season not bad'),
  ('Thea', 'Netball', 'Bellavista', 'U/13', '2026-05-14T12:00:00Z', 'Japari School', 'Drew 7-7', 'N/A'),
  ('Musa Mnguni', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U17', '2026-05-14T12:00:00Z', 'Vorentoe', 'Lost 17-1', 'The game was very slow on our side from the 1st half, we had no communication and lost a lot of balls because we were all playing on one side of the court instead of playing wide. The best part of the game is the fact that even though we were on the losing side, we played fair throughout and maintained a positive attitude until the last whistle. We definitely need to work harder on communication and game management strategies.'),
  ('Ruvimbo Madoka', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U/15', '2026-05-14T12:00:00Z', 'Broadacres', 'Lost 15-6', 'The ladies pushed through their first full four quarter game, they showed perseverance and fought til the end'),
  ('Remi', 'Football', 'Colin Mann', 'U12', '2026-05-14T12:00:00Z', 'Ellanga', 'Lost 2-1', NULL),
  ('Jolie Ngoyi', 'Football', 'Crawford Sandton', 'U7 and u8', '2026-05-14T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford lonehill', 'Won-4-2', 'They played really well and showed great team work today, and enjoyed the game as they were excited while playing.'),
  ('Busani', 'Football', 'Colin Mann', 'U11', '2026-05-14T12:00:00Z', 'Elandia', 'Lost 1-0', 'Unfortunate loss. We conceded early, but the boys fought hard to try come back. Mentally and physically they are gonna be stronger. Now to continue helping them get better technically. Otherwise, good effort I''m proud of them.'),
  ('Paballo', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U19', '2026-05-14T12:00:00Z', 'Broadacres', 'Won 28-10', NULL),
  ('Berneeta Fox', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U15', '2026-05-14T12:00:00Z', 'Vorentoe', 'Lost 12-3', 'The players played well today, even though they lost they played as a team and lost as a team. There is still a lot to work on in terms of passing and communication but the team has improved significantly since their first game'),
  ('Nosipho Dhlamini', 'Football', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U11', '2026-05-13T12:00:00Z', 'Kings school', 'Lost 2-0', 'We are starting to concede less I''m proud of the boys defensive work but we still not converting goals'),
  ('Daniel', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U10', '2026-05-13T12:00:00Z', 'Blue Hills Prep', 'Won 2 - 1', 'Boys played well... we need more work on individual positioning.'),
  ('Jean-Jacques Tshiunza', 'Football', 'Crawford Sandton', 'U/13 B', '2026-05-13T12:00:00Z', 'Lonehill', 'Won 3-2', 'The boys played well, very determined as well as the chemistry showed critical in the team results and hope they can achieve more if they continue to play in the same manner as they played today.'),
  ('Sibusiso', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U15', '2026-05-13T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Victory Park', 'Won 3-2', 'Was a very physical game, and a very positive one, as the tactics we used in training were visible in the game.'),
  ('Jean-Jacques Tshiunza', 'Football', 'Crawford Sandton', 'U/13 A', '2026-05-13T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford Lonehill', 'Lost 3-1', 'The shortage of key players due to regional tournament participation, as well as fitness levels due to back to back fixtures played a big roll with our players performance. I believe we could of won the match if we had the full squad available.'),
  ('Thembi', 'Football', 'Bellavista', 'u13', '2026-05-13T12:00:00Z', 'Summerhill', 'lost 2-1', 'The boys played their first game today and they lost 2-1. Despite the loss i''m really proud of the boys, they fought until the last minute and got rewarded with a goal in the end, they never gave up and worked as a team. I definitely see this being a good season with this team.'),
  ('Lebogang', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U12', '2026-05-13T12:00:00Z', 'Blue hill pre', 'Lost 3-2', 'Satisfied how we handle the first half managing to go ahead leading 2-0 then second half we lost concentration and we conceded silly goals overall happy with the boy''s glad they enjoying football and taking every result as a positive quite happy with the team progress'),
  ('Olebogeng', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U/10', '2026-05-13T12:00:00Z', 'Pinnacle Kyalami', 'Lost 1-0', 'Boys played okay. Bit of improvement. Missed opportunities but overall was pleased that some boys also got a run and there is a lot of basics to work on'),
  ('Oregolele Sekwena', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U9 boys', '2026-05-13T12:00:00Z', 'Pinnacle Kyalami', '2-1 loss', 'Not our best performance, the boys dominated the match in possession and chances created they just failed to convert and the opposition got a last minute goal and won the match'),
  ('Kabelo', 'Football', 'Bellavista', 'U9', '2026-05-13T12:00:00Z', 'Summerhill', 'Won 2-0', 'Chasing after each loose ball or 50 50 balls as a team, that showed passion and the attack was just deadly'),
  ('Coach Edgar', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', '12&13', '2026-05-13T12:00:00Z', 'Pinnacle College Kyalami', '12 won 5-4, 13''s lost 4-2', 'The boys played better today, they tried hard to work the ball possession, which helped with braking the opposition lines and sneaking in passes that created goal scoring opportunities for the team. We still have work to do when it comes to our defence, we need to work on how they should be communicating and working together as a team, so that we don''t make it easy for the opposition to exploit the space behind us.'),
  ('Ross Goodwin', 'Football', NULL, 'U11', '2026-05-13T12:00:00Z', 'Pinnacle College Kyalami', 'Draw 3-3', 'The boys really played well, scoring 3 goals in the first half with no issues. Come second half and it appeared the opposition borrowed boys from another team and subbed them on which completely changed the game as those boys were far better than the ones we played in the first half. Unfortunately the boys couldn''t hold on. Despite the result, the boys have improved a lot and are working hard, small things to tweak but very good overall'),
  ('Lebogang', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U13', '2026-05-13T12:00:00Z', 'Blue hill prep', 'Draw 3-3', 'The boy''s really played well i am impressed so far with the progress of the team a few errors that costed us but this team has exceeded my expectations i am a happy coach and the boy''s are enjoying football'),
  ('Coach Justin', 'Football', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U13', '2026-05-13T12:00:00Z', 'Kings School Robin Hills', 'Lost 4-0', 'The boys played a very tight game, we controlled the first 10 minutes, after a mistake within the first goal, the spirit of the team went down and from there the boys weren''t able to push forward and we ended up with a lose result.'),
  ('Daniel', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U11', '2026-05-13T12:00:00Z', 'Blue Hills Prep', 'Won 5 - 3', 'Boys played well... we need a new keeper.'),
  ('Coach Keah', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U11B', '2026-05-12T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford Forways', 'Draw 1-1', 'The game had a lot of tension due to defending, we need to work on shooting and attitude in the court'),
  ('Nonkululeko', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'U/10', '2026-05-12T12:00:00Z', 'Wendywood primary school', 'Lost Extra time 7 - 6', 'The boys did come back. It was the first time they play full field and they used to play 15min today it was 20min. First half we were nowhere they recovered very well second half scoring 4 goals. Then it happens we lost in that extra time because the game finished 6 - 6 both teams.'),
  ('Daniel', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U11', '2026-05-12T12:00:00Z', 'De La Salle', 'Drew 3 - 3', 'Boys played well away... a lot needs to be worked on with goal keeping.'),
  ('Jean-Jacques Tshiunza', 'Football', 'Crawford Sandton', 'U/13 A', '2026-05-12T12:00:00Z', 'Sharonlea Prim. School', 'Lost 7-1', 'Tough day as we had few complications the teamlist of the squad selection as well as being refused to warm up before kick off... Which was falling the performance. N.B. Communication was given to management and going forward I will be incharge of the team selection.'),
  ('Sam', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'u12', '2026-05-12T12:00:00Z', 'curro riverside', 'won 4-0', 'the boys could have won with more goals not using their opportunities. however, the team fought and ended with a win'),
  ('Coach Keah', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U11B', '2026-05-12T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford Forways', 'Won 3-1', 'They played really well, I saw them applying what we always practice'),
  ('Coach Keah', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U10A', '2026-05-12T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford Forways', 'Lost 10-0', 'The team give their best just that the opposition were a better team, we just need to work on team work'),
  ('Coach Keah', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U10B', '2026-05-12T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford Forways', 'Won 4-0', 'The game was nice, there is a lot of improvement as it is their first season in netball.'),
  ('Beauty', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'Under 13', '2026-05-12T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford international Fourways', 'Win 7-3', 'They redeemed themselves, lost 2 points over miscommunication. Overall proud of the girls and their determination on this game'),
  ('Beauty', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'Under 12', '2026-05-12T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford international Fourways', 'Under 12 loss 13-1', 'The girls work hard but luck wasn''t on their side'),
  ('Coach Sipho', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U19', '2026-05-12T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Waterfall', 'Draw 1-1', 'A fairly even game where both teams played well in possession. Without the ball, we were tactically solid, held our shape well, and competed strongly in duels. We created several chances and did enough to win the game. We conceded on the final three minutes of the game. Lack of communication that caused a goalkeeper error.'),
  ('Lebogang', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U13', '2026-05-12T12:00:00Z', 'Saheti schools', 'Lost 2-0', 'Unfortunately we were disqualified from the tournament due to administrative errors we initially played and lost 12-2 but the forfeit score was 2-0'),
  ('Siseko Venkileni', 'Football', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'U13', '2026-05-12T12:00:00Z', 'Eastleigh primary school', 'Won 3-0', 'Game was good played but we did not use our chances well we need to be more clinical in the box the team is coming along better and we are improving every day but we still got some more work to do as a team'),
  ('Lebogang', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U13', '2026-05-12T12:00:00Z', 'Saheti schools', 'Lost 2-0', 'Unfortunately we were disqualified from the tournament due to administrative errors we initially played and lost 12-2 but the forfeit score was 2-0'),
  ('Jolie Ngoyi', 'Football', 'Crawford Sandton', 'U12 to open', '2026-05-11T12:00:00Z', 'Cosmo city', 'Lost 6-1', 'it was a very hectic game as my girls were not confident to play against the team. most of our players got injured, overall they did their best.'),
  ('Jean-Jacques Tshiunza', 'Football', 'Crawford Sandton', 'U/13', '2026-05-08T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford Pretoria Night Soccer Festival', 'Lost in the final 2-1, to the host Crawford Pretoria', 'My team play excellent throughout the tournament. Becoming the first team to ever reach the finals in the tournament from Crawford Sandton'),
  ('Ross Goodwin', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U11', '2026-05-08T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Protea Glen', 'Lost 4-0', 'Unfortunately the boys were out played today. With a few of the boys being sick, we had no subs so the boys were extremely exhausted. They left their all on the field and that''s what mattered most today'),
  ('UNATHI Thango', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U9-13 Girls', '2026-05-08T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Cosmo City', 'Lost 8-0', 'This was my first game with the girls. The opposition were a lot older, mostly U13 and had more experience and understanding of the game. The Curro Sagewood Girls still lack the basic understanding of the game or their positions. The girls did give their all though. Stand out performances from Kopano, Soso and Tumi. They did do some things we practiced like passing and trying not to bunch up which is very positive from the first week of training so that is great progress. My goal for next game is to have better defensive shape and get some shots on goal. All in all very proud of the girls for going up against a team that was a lot older and stronger.'),
  ('Sam', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'U12', '2026-05-08T12:00:00Z', 'Curro waterfall', 'Lost 2-0', 'The girls started off very well but as the other team scored a goal it seemed like their confidence was low and the other team managed to score another goal again.'),
  ('Siseko', 'Football', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'U13', '2026-05-08T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Aurora', 'Won 3-3', 'The boys played well implementing everything we did at practice sessions. We now just need to work on our passing combinations and work more on our finishing and defense.'),
  ('Nonkululeko', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'Girls senior', '2026-05-08T12:00:00Z', 'Curro waterfall primary school', 'Won 3 - 1', 'The girls try their best playing their first game after most of their matches where disturbed by weather. Today they took that opportunity to play. But still a lot to be done at training.'),
  ('Jolie Ngoyi', 'Football', 'Crawford Sandton', 'U10,u12 and open', '2026-05-08T12:00:00Z', 'Wendy wood', 'Lost 1-0,lost 1-0', 'Team A although they lost their performance was great and they showed me their willingness on how bad they wanted to win. Team B just needs to improve on their team work'),
  ('Shalom', 'Hockey', 'Rallim', 'U11', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'Blouberg Ridge', 'Lost 7-0', 'The girls played very well they are u10s who played against an older age U11s and it was their first time playing half a field they mostly play quarter field and more than half of the team who was suppose to play the U11 match didnt show up so these girls had to play more than their usual match time 2 matches with extended times'),
  ('Berneeta Fox', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U15', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'Deutsche schule', 'Lost 16-0', 'Players weren''t playing as a team, they got to a point in the game whereby they started to let the loss affect their playing. We have a lot to work on moving forward'),
  ('Deon', 'Netball', 'Lion Pride Academy', 'U11', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'Royal mount', 'A Lost 5-8,B lost 30-0 and A lost 13-7', 'A team: The girls played well, but we need to focus more on communication and spacing. They must call clearly for the ball so teammates know their options and they need to spread out to create space instead of crowding each other. B team: The B team still has a lot to work on after this game. We struggled with basic skills, positioning and teamwork, which affected our performance.'),
  ('Musa Mnguni', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U17', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'Deutsche Schule', 'Lost 9-8', 'The team played really well in the first half of the match, however they lost control of the game as soon as they started playing the game according to the opposing team''s pace. A lot of communication and timing will be required in our next match.'),
  ('Musa Mnguni', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U19', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'Deutsche Schule', 'Won 30-8', 'The team played exceptionally. I could see a lot of improvement in our conditioning and endurance, however if we controlled our pace in the game throughout, the result would''ve been 10 times better! I am super proud of how well their overall performance was. We will definitely be working more on how we can control our game instead of just playing to win.'),
  ('Azzy Ngwane', 'Netball', 'Parkview Senior', 'U11', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'IRG SCHOOL', 'Lost : 3-4', 'I''m incredibly proud of my Under 11 team. They came back stronger, supported one another, and truly showed up for themselves. With only one practice session before match day, they''ve worked so hard and continue to improve every single game. What a beautiful comeback. So proud of them'),
  ('Ruvimbo Madoka', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U/15', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'Summerhill secondary school', 'Won 7- 5', 'Girls showed great sportsmanship. They have definitely improved in their communication as a team and their skills. Super proud of them'),
  ('Akimi', 'Hockey', 'Rallim', 'U9', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'Blouberg Ridge', 'Won 2-0', 'The boys played amazingly, everything from their passing to dribbling and overall teamwork. Their chemistry is growing and I''ve built a great relationship with them already.'),
  ('Shalom', 'Hockey', 'Rallim', 'U10', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'Blouberg Ridge', 'Lost 2 -0', 'The girls played very well despite the loss we have to work on attack the girls once an opponent come the girls leave the ball or stop running with the ball'),
  ('Busani', 'Football', 'Colin Mann', 'U11', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'Sunnyridge', 'Won 3-0', 'It was a good game. The boy''s physicality is getting better but still room for improvement. While working on physicality, we also need to work on technical side of things. The passing needs to be more fluid. Other than that, good effort from the boys.'),
  ('Shakirah', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U19', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'Summerhill School', 'Won 23-2', 'Overall teamwork and effort were good, but the team needs to improve communication on court, especially in the first half, as players were not calling for each other enough. They also need to continue working on reducing contact and improving footwork. Overall, it was a positive performance and a well-deserved win.'),
  ('Thembi', 'Netball', NULL, 'u9', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'IRG', 'lost 10-1', 'The girls did not have a good game today, i think positioning and communication was a big issue for us. But nonetheless we will take this result as a positive into the next game and fix our mistakes during training. I believe and am confident in this team to make a comeback.'),
  ('Kabelo', 'Football', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'U8', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford lonehil', '1-0 Win', 'A grinded result. They showed me character and willingness to fight for each other and the badge'),
  ('Kerryn hindle', 'Netball', 'Parkview Senior', 'U10', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'IRG', 'Lost 1-0', 'The girls played really well, it was a new group of girls that haven''t played a match yet so I''m really proud of them'),
  ('Remi', 'Football', 'Colin Mann', 'U12', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'Summerset', 'Draw 3-3', 'Silly mistakes is what costed us in the first half after a few conversations and lucky encounters we came back conceding 0 goals in the second half'),
  ('Beauty', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'Under 13 A team', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'Bryandale primary school', 'Loss 47-1', 'The girls worked hard but to their best as they would, they showed that they are willing but it was a tough opponent we need to work on the leg strength and ball skills more to improve'),
  ('Beauty', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U12 A team and B team', '2026-05-07T12:00:00Z', 'Bryandale primary school', 'Loss- 30-0 : loss 13-1', 'Tough competition the girls played their best.'),
  ('Jerome', 'Football', 'Sandton Sinai', 'U10', '2026-05-06T12:00:00Z', 'Pinnacle Kyalami', 'Lost 6-4', 'Great game, super intense, we played much better structured football with decent shape. Pinnacle scored 3 goals from the center spot from a kick off following our goal. But allowed to teach a lesson'),
  ('Nonkululeko', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'U/10 A & B boys', '2026-05-06T12:00:00Z', 'Blairgowrie', 'A. Won 3-2 and B. Won 3-0', 'It was an amazing game to watch the boys show a lot of energy on the field they where fighting & also playing like a team. This time around right & left wings where awake all the goals came from their crosses.'),
  ('Coach Samo & Coach Lebo', 'Football', 'Parkview Junior', '12B', '2026-05-06T12:00:00Z', 'Blairgowrie', 'Won 3-2', 'Exceptional performance on display just the team needs to improve on the work rate and game management but overall the boy''s played well'),
  ('Coach Samo & Coach Lebo', 'Football', 'Parkview Junior', 'U12A', '2026-05-06T12:00:00Z', 'Blairgowrie', 'Lose 3-2', 'Overall the boy''s played just circumstances out of our control dictated the game hence the results didn''t come our way happy with the performance just a few key areas to fix then the team can compete'),
  ('Kerryn hindle', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U12', '2026-05-06T12:00:00Z', 'Bordeaux primary', 'Lost 7-4', 'The girls played really well, we need to work on defending but unfortunately we don''t have a practice this week so next week we will be working on defending.'),
  ('abbey', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'u13', '2026-05-06T12:00:00Z', 'Bordeaux Primary', 'won 11-5', 'Such beautiful netball played by the girls today. We are finally applying skills taught to our games and i am super proud of the team. Great match performance displayed!'),
  ('Coach Justin', 'Football', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U13', '2026-05-06T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Aurrora', 'Won 5-2', 'The boys played a fantastic game, we started off the game without our usual 11 the boys who were on adapted well and held a strong game, we were 2-0 down when I made changes that resulted in quality football all around. Things to take from: Discipline, Insuring our documents are signed and returned so we are able to attend the game.'),
  ('Nosipho Dhlamini', 'Football', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U11', '2026-05-06T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Aurora', 'Lost 7-0', 'The U11 boys faced a tough match against Curro Aurora, losing 7-0, but the performance showed clear improvement in key areas. The players demonstrated better positional awareness, maintaining their structure and avoiding crowding around the ball, while also showing growing confidence in playing out from the back through short passes. However, the team still needs to increase energy and intensity, especially in pressing and tracking back, and work on creating and converting goal-scoring opportunities.'),
  ('coach abbey', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'u13', '2026-05-04T12:00:00Z', 'Melpark', 'lost 10-22', 'Very tough competition for the girls. Two strong sides going against each other. First half started off strong but the second half was difficult. Minor errors made but nothing that we can''t fix during our session. On court communication needs to improve.'),
  ('Kerryn hindle', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U12', '2026-05-04T12:00:00Z', 'Melpark', 'Lost 13-1', 'The girls played well, we just need to work on defending and how to defend and when to stick with their player and when not to. But I''m proud of them!'),
  ('Kabelo', 'Football', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'U8', '2026-04-30T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford Sandton', 'Lost 1-0', 'First half was flat after conceding the goal. We tried second half and they pushed for the equalizer but I loved the hunger, running for each other and the passion my boys put in. We will be back stronger for our next fixture'),
  ('Jean-Jacques', 'Football', 'Crawford Sandton', 'U/13 A', '2026-04-29T12:00:00Z', 'Buccleuch', 'Lost 4-2', 'This was my first match, with the first team and played hard, unfortunately we fell unlucky due to two bad decisions by the referee, which was an off side goal and penalty call that hit the player in a natural position. There are also few areas that the team needs improvement in, such as fitness, control and movement of the ball as well as transitional player.'),
  ('Ruvimbo Madoka', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U/15', '2026-04-29T12:00:00Z', 'Torrah Academy', 'Lost 11 - 9', 'The team played their first three-quarter match and showed great discipline, pushing through fatigue to compete until the final whistle. Areas to develop include footwork and attacking skills.'),
  ('Jerome', 'Football', 'Sandton Sinai', 'U7-8 and U10''s', '2026-04-29T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford International Fourways', 'U7-8 Won 7-0 / U10 won 5-4', NULL),
  ('Daniel', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U11 and U10', '2026-04-29T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Sagewood', '2 - 1 Loss', 'Both sides played well for an away result, they got the same results. playing home next week we''ll do better.'),
  ('Ross Goodwin', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U11', '2026-04-29T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Rivonia', 'Won 2-1', 'The boys played really well. They put relentless pressure on the opponents from the start and we had many opportunities to score, unfortunately we didn''t. The relentless pressure would again be our downfall as we got exposed at the back and our opponents managed to score. We would still keep up the pressure and eventually equalize. Going into the second half, it was very back and forth but we managed to break through their defense and score again. The boys played really well and are starting to play more as a team and are starting to understand their roles.'),
  ('Lebogang Mokatsola', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U12', '2026-04-29T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Sagewood', 'Lost 9-3', 'We have direction as a team we just need to fix a few things moving forward and we will be able to compete with other teams nonetheless the boy''s played well super proud'),
  ('Lebogang Mokatsola', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U13', '2026-04-29T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Sagewood', 'Won 4-3', 'The win didn''t come easy but the boy''s fought against all odds the team work and work rate was exceptional still need to fix some areas but there is room for improvement'),
  ('Nonkululeko', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'U/10 A & B', '2026-04-29T12:00:00Z', 'Rosebank primary school', 'U/10 A won 2- 0 & B played draw 1- 1', 'It was a better effort from everyone. They created a lot of opportunities every player was cooking today. The defense was absolutely brilliant and what my goalkeepers did today was so amazing a lot of brilliant saves made. All in all was a team effort'),
  ('Olebogeng', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U/10', '2026-04-29T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Rivonia', '2-1 win', 'Still a lot of work to be done. Passing drills, Ball control, Understanding of Positional play.'),
  ('Sam', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'u12', '2026-04-29T12:00:00Z', 'rosebank primary', 'draw 3-3', 'boys gave away the game in the second half, and they started off very well. When they started getting tired that is when they started loosing focus, we were leading 3-1 in the first half and the other team scored 2 more in the second half'),
  ('Coach Edgar', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', '12&13', '2026-04-29T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Rivonia', '12''s Won 10-3, 13''s lost 4-3', 'Good performance from both teams, we need to address the depth issues with the 13''s as they could have done better had there been enough subs.'),
  ('Remi', 'Football', 'Colin Mann', 'U12', '2026-04-28T12:00:00Z', 'Ekureleni', 'Lost 5-1', 'Boys lost focus in the second half and became lazy resulting in conceding 4 goals'),
  ('Busani Ndlovu', 'Football', 'Colin Mann', 'U11', '2026-04-28T12:00:00Z', 'Erkuruleni', 'Lost 2-0', 'They were the better team. The boys did however put in a fight. Now the goal is to put this game behind us and focus on future matches, keep pushing hard at training and get the boys ready for the next game.'),
  ('Daniel', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U10', '2026-04-28T12:00:00Z', 'Sandton Sinai', '5 - 3 Loss', 'Away first game always tough but they played well overall to a better side.'),
  ('Sibusiso', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U15', '2026-04-27T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Barlo Park', '5-3 Win', 'It was a good game, just a drop in confidence when we conceded. But overall I''m proud of my boys.'),
  ('Azande', 'Netball', 'Parkview Senior', 'U11', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Greenside Senior', 'Lost 3-0', 'wasn''t entirely satisfied with how things ended. However, I do recognise that the previous coaching setup may not have fully grounded the players in the fundamentals of netball. When I started working with them, it felt like we had to rebuild their understanding of the game from the ground up. During matches, I found myself coaching continuously from start to finish. That said, they did begin to improve and showed signs of understanding as the game progressed. Moving forward, I would like to focus on teaching the fundamentals more intentionally.'),
  ('Kerryn', 'Netball', 'Parkview Senior', 'U10', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Green side', 'Won 7-3', 'The girls really played well I''m super proud of them, we just need to work on not bunching but either than that they played really really well!'),
  ('Keatlegile', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U11 A&B Team', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford Lonehill', 'Lost 6-1, Won 2-3', 'Girls played really well putting what we practiced into action and came out with a win at the end'),
  ('Keatlegile', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U10B', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford Lonehill', 'Won 2-1', 'It was a friendly and the girls played well for their first match'),
  ('Beauty', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U12''13', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford international school', 'U13s loss 21-0 A team, B team 5-4. U12s team A 14-3 loss B team 15-3', 'Despite the game being tough and having to use the same team for both teams they tried their level best we just need to work on ball control and footwork as the points got deducted from their ball skill and foot positioning.'),
  ('Coach Thembi', 'Netball', NULL, 'u9', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Greenside Primary School', 'Won 6-0', 'The girls played their first game of the season and started off with a win. The results were pretty impressive considering the fact that we''ve only had one training session before the match. They have such good mentality towards the sport and are eager to fix mistakes. They also work very well as a team and communication is on point, looking forward to a good season with them.'),
  ('Keatlegile', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U10A', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford Lonehill', 'Lost 11-1', 'The girls played well kept losing the ball from rebounds after shoot and not making a basket'),
  ('Ruvimbo Madoka', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U/15', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Centennial school', 'Won 8-1', 'Girls only played two quarters as they were extremely tired! Showed great commitment, teamwork and sportsmanship'),
  ('Siseko Venkileni', 'Football', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'Grade1', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Reddam House Waterfall', 'Won 2-0', 'Great game lots of ball skills need to be implemented in the training session and start teaching them position play its at age that they learn positions otherwise game was fun.'),
  ('Ndumiso Mvelase', 'Football', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U7 and u8', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Trinity house glenvista', 'U7 4-4 , U8 lost 7-1', 'Good game from both teams. Unfortunately couldn''t get a win but both teams showed good fight.'),
  ('Berneeta Fox', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U15', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Northriding', 'Lost 1-6', 'Players had a strong defence, but too many contact/obstruction penalties cost us. Need to improve footwork, discipline, endurance and court vision.'),
  ('Paballo', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', NULL, '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Centennial', 'Won 24 - 5', NULL),
  ('Musa Mnguni', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U19', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Northriding', 'Won 24-8', 'The players were exceptional from the first to the last whistle. They started getting tired during the 3rd quarter since they had no subs, but they pushed harder during the last quarter of the game. I loved how disciplined and respectful they were during the game and listened to the umpires call each time without hesitation. It was amazing to watch them give it their all despite the fatigue.'),
  ('Musa Mnguni', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U17', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Northriding', 'Won 6-5', 'Players were a bit intimidated in the first half of the game, the opposing team set the tone, dominating during the first half, and kept momentum. Players took over the game, there was better control, communication and minimum fouls. Overall, they played really well!'),
  ('Siseko Venkileni', 'Football', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'Grade 2', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Reddam House Waterfall', 'Drew 1-1', 'Good team just the same they also need to work on ball skills e.g passing, tapping, kicking and controlling. Then introduce tackling and marking.'),
  ('Shalom', 'Hockey', 'Rallim', 'U10 A', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Milnerton primary', 'Lost 6-0', 'Despite the loss my team played very well however I need to strengthen the defense, they tend to day dream at the goal post also we need to work on communication and not being afraid of the opponent they must go and get the ball also they must work on stopping the ball and playing it immediately'),
  ('Shalom', 'Hockey', 'Rallim', 'U10 B', '2026-04-23T12:00:00Z', 'Milnerton primary', 'Draw 0-0', 'Great defence from my B team they definitely listened on marking a player most of the kids on this team is new to the sport so we have to work on not scoring an own goal, running while looking up and see who you hitting to, communicate also not everyone has to be at the goal post they need to spread out more'),
  ('Oregolele Sekwena', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U9 boys', '2026-04-22T12:00:00Z', 'Reddford Waterfall', '5-2', 'The boys held most of the possession and they controlled the pace of the game which allowed them to make more penetrative passes towards the opposition side, creating more chances which they converted into goals. It was an amazing performance from the boys, only issue they encountered was defending counter attacks. They couldnt seem to track back fast enough and they left the goalkeeper isolated and they conceded 2 goals'),
  ('Coach Justin & Coach Nosispo', 'Football', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U11 / U13', '2026-04-22T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Wilgehuel', 'U11 lost 3-1 U13 4-4', 'Overall both teams started off strong during the u11 game we gave away possession too easily and we didnt follow through with our tackles towards the second half they were very tired and it shows we need to work on our fitness. U13s game was excellent overall good work from the boys, holding possession and good counter attacking football we need to work on our fitness as well as confidence this will help us convert our chances'),
  ('Coach Sipho', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U19', '2026-04-22T12:00:00Z', 'Lion Fountain College', 'Won 2-0', 'Solid 90 minutes and a deserved 2-0 win. We executed the game plan, stayed disciplined and managed the game well from start to finish. We kept a clean sheet against a good Lion Fountain side. Both goals came from patterns we''ve drilled. Areas of improvement: Final Ball, Def/Att Set-Pieces.'),
  ('Ross Goodwin', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U11', '2026-04-22T12:00:00Z', 'Reddford House Blue Hills', 'Lost 5-1', 'The boys had a bright start early into the game and we took control and had 4 opportunities in the first few minutes. Unfortunately we weren''t able to put them away which later costed us. With the boys being so heavy on attack, it left them exposed at the back and the opposition were able to capitalize on this during their counter attack. The boys kept fighting and kept knocking on the door and were eventually rewarded with a goal. Unfortunately that was all the boys could do as they were exhausted by the end'),
  ('Siseko Venkileni', 'Football', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'U13', '2026-04-22T12:00:00Z', 'Reddam House Waterfall', 'Drew 2-2', 'Game was quite a bit stressful but we manage to come back second half from 2-0 down receiving two penalties and recovering from our first half mistake made us come back and we still have a few things to work on like eye coordination, first touch control and movements on the field during game situations.'),
  ('Paballo', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'Seniors U/19', '2026-04-22T12:00:00Z', 'Hope Foundation', 'Won 15 - 6', NULL),
  ('Sam', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', NULL, '2026-04-22T12:00:00Z', 'Bordeaux primary', '(Team A 5-1 loss) (Team B 3-1 win)', 'the boys fought, tried their best however it was a difficult game to play. The ref had many calls which i feel like he was unfair, favouring more of his team and for both A and the B team.'),
  ('Ndumiso Mvelase', 'Football', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U9', '2026-04-22T12:00:00Z', 'Curro wilgeheuwel', 'Lost 7-0', 'Tough day at the office for the u9 side. Conceded 5 goals in the first half, which then made it difficult for them to come back in the second half. They showed good fight even though the results did not go their way.'),
  ('Olebogeng', 'Football', 'Curro Sagewood', 'U/10', '2026-04-22T12:00:00Z', 'Reddford blue hills', '2-2', 'Lots of improvement left. Ball control, Heading, Shooting, Passing, Building confidence and team moral'),
  ('Jean-Jacques', 'Football', 'Crawford Sandton', 'U/12 B', '2026-04-22T12:00:00Z', 'Bryandale Primary School', 'Lost 4-0', 'Our team consisted of 8-10 first time to Grassroot ability players, also the wet pitch conditions really exposed us during the first half, where we conceded most (3 goals). I was able to adjust the teams formation and encourage the players to be more aggressive when competing for the ball in 50/50 challenges for second half. Man Of The Match: Goalkeeper, Advia, superb performance which got him promoted to the U/13 A.'),
  ('Nonkululeko', 'Football', 'Parkview Senior', 'U/10 A & B', '2026-04-22T12:00:00Z', 'Bordeaux Primary school', 'U/10 A lost 2 -1 then B lost 3 - 1', 'Much better than last week. A lot of improvement to the players they show intent today and a bit of fighting. Still need to fix a few things again at training, shooting drills a lot.'),
  ('Kerryn hindle', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'U12', '2026-04-22T12:00:00Z', 'IRG', 'Lost 10-3', 'The girls played well, we still have a lot to work on but now I see exactly what we need to work on!'),
  ('Coach Sipho & Coach Lebo', 'Football', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U19', '2026-04-22T12:00:00Z', 'Hope fountain combined', 'Won 2-0', 'The boy''s played well showed heart even though we still lacking in a few positions it''s something we will have to work on along the way. Overall good home performance very dominant display hope to continue with the strong performance'),
  ('abbeygail dludla', 'Netball', 'Reddford House Northcliff', 'u13', '2026-04-22T12:00:00Z', 'IR griffith', 'won 11-3', 'First half the game started off a little rocky. Second half, the girls played so well and communicated with each other nicely - Still little things we need to fix and tweak at practice to improve match performance. But over all very impressed by the performance shown by the girls today.'),
  ('Coach Victor', 'Football', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'U/12', '2026-04-22T12:00:00Z', 'Reddam waterfall', '11-0', 'We faced a very strong side nonetheless the boys tried. We have to work more on our midfield fitness and concentration and be more aggressive'),
  ('Jerome', 'Football', 'Sandton Sinai', 'U10', '2026-04-21T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Rivonia', 'Won 5-3', 'Actually a really well fought match from both sides, first match of the season under the belt.'),
  ('Beauty', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U12''13', '2026-04-21T12:00:00Z', 'Buccleugh primary school', 'U12 win 13-0, u13 loss 23-7', 'The girls tried their level best but luck was not on their side they let the ball go in moments which were critical.'),
  ('Ndumiso Mvelase', 'football', 'Reddford house northcliff int.', NULL, '2026-04-16T12:00:00Z', 'Winchester Ridge Primary', 'Won 6-0', 'Great soccer match between both teams, unfortunately Reddhouse happened to be stronger than the opposition. The kids seemed to be having a lot of fun on the park. Great result by the way side on their first match.'),
  ('Akimi Tsholetsane', 'hockey', 'Rallim', NULL, '2026-04-16T12:00:00Z', 'Edgemead A Team', 'Drew 2-2', 'The boys played well. Their spacing and passing was excellent. We need to just improve our defence, but overall I''m proud of the team.'),
  ('Akimi Tsholetsane', 'hockey', 'RALLIM', NULL, '2026-04-16T12:00:00Z', 'Edgemead', 'A team d', NULL),
  ('Keah', 'netball', 'Curro Rivonia u11', NULL, '2026-04-16T12:00:00Z', 'Bryneven Primary', 'Lost 10-0', 'The game was heated. The players still need to be taught sportsmanship and behaviour on the court. They also need to be reminded of the netball rules and how to apply them. Overall the girls tried their best but didn''t reach our intended goal of the day.'),
  ('Keah', 'netball', 'Curro Rivonia u10', NULL, '2026-04-16T12:00:00Z', 'Bryneven Primary', 'Lost 17-0', 'The game was really an eye opener since it was our first match day. We had a bit of a disadvantage since we had only 1 day of practise. The players need a lot of work with understanding the rules and how to apply them also to learn not to take losing to heart. Overall it was an experience to help touch up on the team spirit.'),
  ('Busani Ndlovu', 'football', 'Colin Mann', NULL, '2026-04-16T12:00:00Z', 'Dunamis', 'Won 6-0', 'Good effort from the boys however there''s still a lot of work to be done in multiple areas of the game, such as, understanding of positions and how to keep structure, fitness, passing patterns and fluidity of said passes. But overall Good effort all round, definitely room for growth and there is potential.'),
  ('Beauty', 'netball', 'Curro rivonia', NULL, '2026-04-16T12:00:00Z', 'Braneven primary school', 'Loss- 22:00', 'The team played well besides the loss. Their communication was good its just a matter of creating a connecting team so they can use their ball opportunities.'),
  ('Shalom', 'hockey', 'Rallim Prepretory', NULL, '2026-04-16T12:00:00Z', 'Edgemead primary school', 'Lost 2-0', 'Even though the results werent in our favour the players were brave and showed great attacking spirit today, they took the game to the opposition and didn''t hold back. It was wonderful to see them trying new passes and playing as a team. We''ll spend the next few trainings working on our defensive positioning and making sure each player stays close to their marker, so we can support one another more effectively. Overall, a really positive performance with lots of effort and good sportsmanship from the whole team.'),
  ('Akimi Tsholetsane', 'hockey', 'Akimi Tsholetsane', NULL, '2026-04-16T12:00:00Z', 'Edgemead B team', 'Lost 3-1', 'This was my weaker team, but overall they did well. A few basics we need to refine, but I can see improvement in their skill level.'),
  ('Oregolele Sekwena', 'football', 'Curro Sagewood U9 boys, team A', NULL, '2026-04-15T12:00:00Z', 'Reddam Waterfall U9 boys ,team A', 'Lost 8-1', 'The boys played with heart and passion, they just need a bit more time to train together'),
  ('Jean', 'football', 'Crawford Int School Sandton', NULL, '2026-04-15T12:00:00Z', 'Montrose Primary school', 'Lost 6-1', 'The team was comprised of kids that wanted try out, due to the weather that affected us during the previous days. But we should be able to get back going forward.'),
  ('Coach Edgar', 'football', 'Curro Sagewood U12/13', NULL, '2026-04-15T12:00:00Z', 'Reddford Waterfall', 'Lost 11-0', NULL),
  ('Olebogeng', 'football', 'Curro Sagewood', NULL, '2026-04-15T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Waterfall', 'Lost 5-4', 'Improvement in: Positional play, Understanding positions, Passing, shooting and ball control. Basics of football to be taught'),
  ('Sam', 'football', 'Parkview senior', NULL, '2026-04-15T12:00:00Z', 'Craighall', '(Team A 3-1 loss) (Team B 2-1 win)', 'Team A- first game without any practice, the boys didn''t have a single practice and based on how they played, i think they did well and there''s room for improvement which we will get once we get our practice sessions. Team B- these boys were very hungry, they were playing absolutely well.'),
  ('Nonkululeko', 'football', 'Parkview senior under 10''s A & B', NULL, '2026-04-15T12:00:00Z', 'Craighall primary school', 'A. Lost 4-3 & B. Lost 5-0', 'There is a lot of potential in the team the only thing that needs to understand that football is a team work/sport not individual sport.'),
  ('Oregolele Sekwena', 'football', 'Curro Sagewood U9 boys, team B', NULL, '2026-04-15T12:00:00Z', 'Reddam Waterfall U9 boys ,team B', 'Won 7-1', 'The boys had a wonderful performance and they won what they deserved'),
  ('Tshepiso Mokwatsi', 'football', 'U11 Curro Sagewood', NULL, '2026-04-15T12:00:00Z', 'Reddam Waterfall', 'Lost 8 - 0', 'The boys tried their best on the day. Although it was a tough day in the office there were contributing factors. On the day we had 6 of our good players not show up, because they didn''t receive letters, we also had 9 players and the other team had a full team.'),
  ('Beauty', 'Netball', 'Curro Rivonia', 'U12''13', '2026-04-14T12:00:00Z', 'Braneven primary school', 'Loss- 22:00', 'The girls played amazing despite it being their first match and without practice. Still a lot of work to be done with them, but they have showed commitment.'),
  ('Mpho', 'Netball', 'Curro Aurora', 'u7', '2026-04-13T12:00:00Z', 'Eunice', 'Won 5-0', 'Great teamwork'),
  ('Mpho', 'Netball', 'Curro Aurora', 'u7', '2026-04-13T12:00:00Z', 'Eunice', 'won 5-0', 'Great teamwork'),
  ('Ken', 'softball', 'Curro Sagewood', NULL, '2026-03-18T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Wilgeheuwel', '0-0', 'Match cancelled due to bad weather'),
  ('Tshepiso Mokwatsi', 'cricket', 'U9 Curro Sagewood', NULL, '2026-03-11T12:00:00Z', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', 'Won by 17 runs', 'The boys played well, the bowlers were on fire today. The fielding was also good.'),
  ('Harnu', 'cricket', 'Bellavista commonwealth', NULL, '2026-03-04T12:00:00Z', 'Saxonville', 'Bellavista won by 15 runs', 'Was a tough day in the office for my boys but they managed to grind out the win'),
  ('Olebogeng', 'cricket', 'Bryandale', NULL, '2026-03-04T12:00:00Z', 'Wendywood', 'Lost by 30 runs', 'Fielding must improve. Too many drop catches. Bowling must improve. Too many wides. Accuracy must improve'),
  ('Nonkululeko', 'cricket', 'Bryandale primary school', NULL, '2026-03-04T12:00:00Z', 'Rivonia Primary School', 'Rivonia won by 9 wickets with 12 overs spare', 'We won a toss decided to have a bat but we couldn''t keep up with Rivonia bowlers. They really bowled superb all of their bowlers more especially the off spin opener who took 4 wickets. Rivonia managed to reach the score quickly with 12 overs spare.'),
  ('Daniel', 'cricket', 'Parkview Commonwealth A', NULL, '2026-03-04T12:00:00Z', 'Craighall', 'Won by 10 wickets', 'Craighall was a way better and polished side... 5/5 wins for them this season. 58/8 runs put on the board on our side was simply not enough to win... fielding was perfect. Bowling has been at its best but our boys again struggled to hit the 4s and 6s required. Long deep hours of batting fundamentals need to be taught.'),
  ('Jolie Ngoyi', NULL, 'Crawford', NULL, '2026-03-04T12:00:00Z', 'Redhill', 'Lost 16-43', 'Today the girls did not do so well, on the singles match the girls lost all their matches due to less confidence. On the doubles they also lost even though they had a great start but lost focus during their matches.'),
  ('Coach Edgar', 'cricket', 'Curro Sagewood U11', NULL, '2026-03-03T12:00:00Z', 'Jubilate', 'Won by 10 wickets!', 'The boys are now playing cricket, every match they played they take very serious. We managed to bowl the opposition out for 28 runs.'),
  ('Remi', 'cricket', 'Bryandale u8', NULL, '2026-03-02T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford lonehill', 'Lost 44-22', NULL),
  ('Ross Goodwin', 'cricket', 'Curro Sagewood', NULL, '2026-03-02T12:00:00Z', 'Christ Church', 'Lost by 8 wickets', 'We lost the toss and were sent in to bat first. I was very happy with the batting, I think everyone had greatly improved with the bat and I am super happy with that. We managed to score 56 runs in our 20 overs. When we came on to bowl, we started off well, however we bowled too many no balls which unfortunately lost us the game.'),
  ('Sam', 'cricket', 'Curro halfway gardens', NULL, '2026-03-02T12:00:00Z', 'Christ church', 'Lost 58 to 9', 'We had no numbers, we had to face 13 players on 6 players thats why we couldnt play so good at all'),
  ('Katelyn', 'basketball', 'U13 Reddford House Northcliff', NULL, '2026-02-28T12:00:00Z', 'U13 Crawford Int', 'Won 13 - 7', 'Very good possible last game. They were finding better passes and making a lot of shots. Way better teamwork, but still room to improve in other aspects'),
  ('Jolie Ngoyi', 'tennis', 'Crawford international', NULL, '2026-02-26T12:00:00Z', 'Grayston', 'Won 45-18', 'The boys did so well today, they won all their singles with great scores and they had so much fun while playing. They also did well on their doubles, great ground strokes, early preparation and consistency was seen with the boys team'),
  ('Harnu kloppers', 'cricket', 'Bryandale U/9', NULL, '2026-02-26T12:00:00Z', 'Dainfern', 'Bryandale won by 6 wickets', 'Kids are really playing good cricket, there are some points to work on. But the more we work on it the more it will start showing in the boys.'),
  ('Tshepiso Mokwatsi', 'cricket', 'U9 Curro Sagewood', NULL, '2026-02-26T12:00:00Z', 'CHPS', 'Lost by 3 runs', 'The boys played very well, but we gave away runs, when we were bowling. Which helped the other team a lot. Also the opposition umpires are bad, they make their own rules and add points, but nevertheless it was good competition.'),
  ('Jean', 'tennis', 'Crawford Int School Sandton', NULL, '2026-02-26T12:00:00Z', 'Steyn City', 'Lost 44-21', 'Today was not our best day, as our players concentration levels got best of them. Lost points carelessly due to poor serves and shoot selection, mainly due to tactical choices and playing to their opponents strengths and terms of play in both our singles and doubles. We look towards fixing these errors in our next training.'),
  ('Kerryn', 'softball', 'Curro sagewood', NULL, '2026-02-26T12:00:00Z', 'Trinity randpark', 'Won 11-3', 'The girls played absolutely amazing!!! I''m super proud of them, they have come a long way and I can start to see improvements within the team! First win of the season!!!!!'),
  ('Ndumiso Mvelase', 'cricket', 'Bryandale Primary open C', NULL, '2026-02-25T12:00:00Z', 'Wendywood Primary', 'Bryandale lost by 6 wickets', 'Even though the result didn''t go our way, it was a very good match. A couple of catches needed to be taken to ensure that the results go in our favour but unfortunately that was not the case. Still a lot of room for improvement.'),
  ('Daniel', 'cricket', 'Parkview Commonwealth A', NULL, '2026-02-25T12:00:00Z', 'Blairgowrie', 'Lost by 44 runs', 'Too many wides and unnecessary extras. Fielding was average, but not the main issue. Credit to the opposition: their batters were clearly well-trained and technically strong. Victory (one of our players) was exceptional - 111 runs, he was Player of the Match, and the only century across both teams. He carried the innings for the second consecutive game. The difference was depth: one player performed at a high level; the rest couldn''t match that standard. Major improvement is needed in bowling discipline and batting POWER.'),
  ('Jolie Ngoyi', 'tennis', 'Crawford', NULL, '2026-02-25T12:00:00Z', 'SAHETI', 'Lost 23~40', 'Although we lost, the girls won all their doubles matches which was a great improvement for the girls. The girls did not play so well on the singles as most of the girls did double faults on their serves but overall they improved so much.'),
  ('Coach Kabelo', 'cricket', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', NULL, '2026-02-25T12:00:00Z', 'Reddam Waterfall', 'Won by 7 wickets', 'I liked the communication in the field. I liked the motivation during our fielding and the running between the wickets was amazing too'),
  ('Harnu kloppers', 'cricket', 'Bellavista u/13', NULL, '2026-02-25T12:00:00Z', 'Linksfield primary', 'Bellavista won by 8 wickets', 'There is a lot of focus points for us but our standards have not dropped.'),
  ('Nonkululeko', 'cricket', 'Bryandale primary school', NULL, '2026-02-25T12:00:00Z', 'Heron Bridge College', 'Won by 20 runs', 'It was a very interesting game for me I liked how the boys Fielded 3 run outs and a fiver for two bowlers. Batting needs to work out more but atleast we ridged 90 runs batted whole 20 overs.'),
  ('Remi', 'cricket', 'Bryndale', NULL, '2026-02-23T12:00:00Z', 'Reddam waterfall', 'Draw 32', NULL),
  ('Remi', 'cricket', 'Bryndale u8 team 2', NULL, '2026-02-23T12:00:00Z', 'Reddam waterfall', 'Won by 7 runs', NULL),
  ('Sam', 'cricket', 'Curro halfway gardens', NULL, '2026-02-23T12:00:00Z', 'Sagewood', 'Lost 27 to 38', 'The boys could have had a better game, the boys were not as focused and didnt really have much interest in the game on this particular day but also it was very hot. I think thats why the concentration was not so good, however i believe we can always do better with how they played, because this shows the potential that they have'),
  ('Remi', 'cricket', 'Bryndale', NULL, '2026-02-23T12:00:00Z', 'Reddam waterfall', 'Drew 32', NULL),
  ('Daniel', 'cricket', 'Parkview Commonwealth B', NULL, '2026-02-23T12:00:00Z', 'Craighall', 'Lost by 15 runs', 'Opposition - 116/4. Us 101/7. Most runs came through disciplined running and extras rather than boundaries. Inclusive bowling opportunities allowed new bowlers to take wickets and that significantly boosted confidence. The overall improvement was substantial; batting and bowling were more refined, we surpassed 100 runs. We need to focus more on fielding communication and captain-led energy, improving wicketkeeping positioning, and developing greater batting POWER.'),
  ('Ross Goodwin', 'cricket', 'Curro Sagewood', NULL, '2026-02-23T12:00:00Z', 'Crawford Lonehill', 'Lost by 9 wickets', 'The batting has definitely improved, we not losing too many wickets early on and they getting more comfortable with hitting the ball and running between the wickets. The bowling is slowly getting there, again just too many extras given to them, so bowling will be the main focus at practice, however there was a big improvement today'),
  ('Harnu kloppers', 'cricket', 'Bryandale u/9 A', NULL, '2026-02-19T12:00:00Z', 'Bryaneven', 'Bryandale won by 8 wickets', 'Could not see much as the opposition only scored 22 and we only scored 7 runs where the rest came from wides and No balls'),
  ('Daniel', 'cricket', 'Parkview Commonwealth A', NULL, '2026-02-18T12:00:00Z', 'Rosebank Primary School', 'Won by 8 wickets', 'Absolute dominance from the boys, disciplined in both the batting and bowling departments, at the end of their batting innings we stopped them at 54/7, when we got into the batting our opener went wild scoring a couple 4s and 6s, even with 2 wickets taken away from us, our opener led us to the 55 needed to win the game with plenty of overs left to spare, though improvements are still needed in batting communication and bowling composure. Overall strong performance and a good game.'),
  ('Katelyn', 'basketball', 'Reddford House U13 Boys', NULL, '2026-02-18T12:00:00Z', 'Heronbridge College', 'Lost 8 -9', 'Very tight game, the boys are so willing to play, but just need to work on sharing the ball, and doing so in time. We also don''t shoot which could''ve contributed a lot to our points but it''s all positive feedback and things to work on at practice. Otherwise, they''ve improved so well so far in terms of discipline and respect.'),
  ('Katelyn', 'basketball', 'U12 Boys', NULL, '2026-02-18T12:00:00Z', 'Heronbridge College', 'Drew 4 - 4', 'It was a friendly game, I had to attend to the U13''s as the matches were at the same time but the boys did well and new boys also got an opportunity to play for the first time today.'),
  ('Kabelo', 'cricket', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', NULL, '2026-02-18T12:00:00Z', 'Grayston', 'Lost by 60 runs', 'I need to work on team morale. They got discouraged by the consistent boundaries and they automatically drop their heads. In terms of performance i am happy. I saw a lot of good bowling and thats emphasis on how hard we worked on our bowling this week. Batting is a bit shaky as we constantly have to rely on 1 batsman to get us the runs but we go back to the drawing board.'),
  ('Edgar', 'cricket', 'Curro Sagewood U11', NULL, '2026-02-17T12:00:00Z', 'Beaulieu primary', 'Lost by 4 wickets', 'The team had a good performance overall, there wasn''t much that they could have done with the level of skill we were up against.'),
  ('Ross Goodwin', 'cricket', 'Curro Sagewood', NULL, '2026-02-16T12:00:00Z', 'CHPS', 'Lost by 9 wickets', 'We won the toss and chose to bat first. We started off strong and got a couple runs on the board and only lost 1 wicket and retired 2 players. We managed to score 68 in our 20 overs which is big improvement. When we went to bowl we also started off strong and got a wicket. However there were still too many extras bowled which lost us the game.'),
  ('Tshepiso Mokwatsi', 'cricket', 'U9 Curro Sagewood', NULL, '2026-02-12T12:00:00Z', 'Christ Church', 'Won by 8 wickets', 'The behavior was much better, team selection was different, the attitude and teamwork was positive. Another superstar individual performance. 56 runs and 2 wickets from our team captain.'),
  ('Kerryn', 'softball', 'Curro sagewood', NULL, '2026-02-12T12:00:00Z', 'Kings college', 'Lost 12-4', 'The girls played well, it was a different squad of girls, we need to work on batting well from the beginning I have seen an improvement in their batting but I''m not sure if they nervous in the beginning but we only batted well in the second innings, fielding was good, But regardless they still played well and I''m proud of them!'),
  ('Jean-Jacques Tshiunza', 'tennis', 'Crawford Int. Sandton Senior Boys B team', NULL, '2026-02-12T12:00:00Z', 'Kyalami Prep.', 'Lost 44 - 19', 'Today''s match was tough, as our opponents were a formidable group of players as they showed excellent plays from their technique, to their shoot selections.'),
  ('Katelyn', 'basketball', 'Reddford House Northcliff U12 Biys', NULL, '2026-02-11T12:00:00Z', 'Pecanwood College', 'Lost 45 - 22', 'They played really well and were able to play better as a team compared to their first game against this school. The main focus was defence which still needs some work, but the team is strong. Just needs more structure in terms of every player attending training so they can learn plays.'),
  ('Harnu', 'cricket', 'Bellavista 1st team', NULL, '2026-02-11T12:00:00Z', 'Sacret Heart', 'Tied (Sacret Heart) 113/8 (Bellavista) 113/6', 'This was an amazing game with a lot of excitement from beginning to end. My boys had their ups and downs but they have shown me 2 key points - The willingness to never give up - They can handle pressure'),
  ('Kabelo', 'cricket', 'Curro Halfway Gardens', NULL, '2026-02-11T12:00:00Z', 'King College Bryanston', 'Lost by 40 runs', 'My boys played well. Bowled a lot of dot balls. I liked the delivery variations we used during the match which showed game reading. In terms of batting we couldn''t keep our innings going, as it was wicket after wicket but we will work on that. There''s light at the end of the tunnel. My boys will get back to winning ways again.'),
  ('Jolie', 'tennis', 'Crawford Girls team', NULL, '2026-02-11T12:00:00Z', 'Redhill', 'Lost 45-18', 'On the girls singles matches today most of our girls had a late preparation on the ball, late contact, most of their first serves were out. In doubles although we lost our girls had a good teamwork but lost due to many force errors meaning most of their balls hit the net or out. Regardless of us losing I think our girls took this loss as a learning experience and they did not give up regardless of their opponents leading in most of the games.'),
  ('Coach Edgar', 'cricket', 'Curro Sagewood U11', NULL, '2026-02-10T12:00:00Z', 'Christchurch primary school', 'Lost by 9 wickets', 'The team didn''t bat as well as we should have, we lost a lot of runs due to balls left, it has given me a clear batting line up for the upcoming matches.'),
  ('Ross Goodwin', 'cricket', 'Curro Sagewood', NULL, '2026-02-09T12:00:00Z', 'Buccluech', 'Lost by 9 wickets', 'We lost the toss and batted first. We started off slow as their bowling was very good. However we stabilized and started to score runs. We were bowled out for 36. Our bowling was very good, not as many extras and everyone was fairly accurate throughout. Our wicket keeper even took a catch which was a big positive. Unfortunately they managed to chase the score down and won with 9 wickets left'),
  ('Samokelo', 'cricket', 'Curro half way gardens U/8', NULL, '2026-02-09T12:00:00Z', 'Jubilate School', 'We won 18 wickets to 14', 'Today i believe the boys could have done way better because i know their potentials and they were not as focused as the last match and even though they were not fully in the game they still managed to win.'),
  ('Daniel', 'cricket', 'Commonwealth B', NULL, '2026-02-09T12:00:00Z', 'De La Salle', 'Lost by 3 wicket', 'In observance of the new team I am assigned to, the result was largely influenced by avoidable errors. Batting was reasonably competitive, with good intent and boundary scoring, though consistency can improve. The main issues were bowling discipline and, more significantly, fielding, where a lack of urgency and basic execution led to multiple preventable boundaries and extra runs. While there was a noticeable improvement in focus and effort during the closing stages of the innings, this intensity needs to be maintained throughout the match. Moving forward, priority should be given to improving fielding fundamentals, bowling control, and overall game awareness.');
